  "prefLabel": "Fam 103.04 Meetings",
  "priorExpiration": "2002-12-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 103.04 Meetings. The board shall hold 6 regular meetings each year, one each in January, March, May, June or July or August, September, and November, and special meetings at such times as it may deem necessary. If a regular meeting cannot occur on the designated day because of a lack of a quorum, weather conditions, or an emergency, it shall be rescheduled within the specified month.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10; ss by #14430 (formerly Fam 104.01), eff 11-22-25",
